      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4" data-lang="howto.title">How to Use Wplace Paint Tool</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600" data-lang="howto.subtitle">Convert images to pixel art in 4 simple steps</p>
