          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900" data-lang="howto.step1.title">Upload Your Image</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang="howto.step1.desc">Click the upload area or drag and drop your PNG, JPG, or SVG file. Our converter supports all common image formats.</p>
        </div>
