          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed" data-lang="howto.step2.desc">Use the slider to control the pixel size. Smaller values create more detailed art, larger values produce chunky, abstract pixel art.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-lg font-bold mb-4">
